{"words": [{"text": "۞ أَلَمْ", "translation": "Did not"}, {"text": "تَرَ", "translation": "you see"}, {"text": "إِلَى", "translation": "[to]"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "خَرَجُوا۟", "translation": "went out"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "دِيَـٰرِهِمْ", "translation": "their homes"}, {"text": "وَهُمْ", "translation": "and they"}, {"text": "أُلُوفٌ", "translation": "(were in) thousands"}, {"text": "حَذَرَ", "translation": "(in) fear"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَوْتِ", "translation": "(of) [the] death"}, {"text": "فَقَالَ", "translation": "Then said"}, {"text": "لَهُمُ", "translation": "to them"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "مُوتُوا۟", "translation": "Die"}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "then"}, {"text": "أَحْيَـٰهُمْ ۚ", "translation": "He restored them to life"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "لَذُو", "translation": "(is) surely Possessor"}, {"text": "فَضْلٍ", "translation": "(of) bounty"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "for"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "translation": "[the] mankind"}, {"text": "وَلَـٰكِنَّ", "translation": "[and] but"}, {"text": "أَكْثَرَ", "translation": "most"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "translation": "(of) the people"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "(are) not"}, {"text": "يَشْكُرُونَ", "translation": "grateful"}], "sahih": "Have you not considered those who left their homes in many thousands, fearing death? Allāh said to them, \"Die\"; then He restored them to life. And Allāh is the possessor of bounty for the people, but most of the people do not show gratitude."}